We've seen an increase in the numbers of people who are applying for food stamps.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:23.709
or are relying on food stamps.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:30.279
But all of those programs, don't you know, they still outstrip or the need is still outstripped by those programs.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:36.999
SNAP not only is it easy for families who are experiencing food insecurity,.

00:06:37.149 --> 00:06:41.350
who suffered a job loss, who have gone through a health crisis to purchase.

00:06:41.529 --> 00:06:48.790
That food right in there at the retailer, which helps our our food supply chain work in its most efficient way.

