In April, the USDA launched a program aimed at helping both hungry Americans and food producers.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:16.129
The Coronavirus Food Assistance Program, which gave 19 billion dollars to farmers.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:21.561
The Coronavirus Food Assistance Program is is a great first step toward that effort.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:26.194
to immediately provide support to farmers and provide the financial support.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:36.171
So that they can process that food and make it available in partnership with folks who and companies

